# FANUC ARC Mate (A05B-1203-B255) with a pneumatic tool changer, for
# arm_sim: the master plate on the flange (40 mm, lock stroke 0.1 s, no
# tool at start), the tools in tools.txt in their docks, the gripper's
# drive for tool 2.
include arcmate_base.arm
changer 0.1 0
body 6 capsule 0 0 0.005   0 0 0.035   0.04   # changer master plate (80 mm)
include tools.txt
gripper drive gripper.conf sim.txt
gripper mech 4 80 0.3 0.00001 0.01
gripper jaw 0.19 0.06 0.03
gripper tool 2
